.\}
configured saptune major version (from the central saptune
configuration file)
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
enabled Solution
.br
The entry \*(Aqenabled Solution\*(Aq shows the Solution, which was manually
applied by \*(Aq\fIsaptune solution apply <solution name>\fP\*(Aq and its related
Notes.
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
.  sp -1
