.  IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
additional enabled Notes, sorted lexicographically
.br
The entry \*(Aqadditional enabled Notes\*(Aq shows all Notes, which were
additionally applied manually by \*(Aq\fIsaptune note apply <note name>\fP\*(Aq.
They are \fBone\fP part of the list of notes in the entry \*(Aqapplied Notes\*(Aq
and \*(Aqenabled Notes\*(Aq.
.RE
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
.el \{\
