\fI/usr/share/saptune/sols\fP
.RS 3
.ll -.6i
.sp
part of the \fBPackage Area\fP
.br
the saptune solution definitions, which are shipped by the saptune RPM
package
.sp
Please do not change as maintenance updates of package saptune will
overwrite these files without preserving any custom changes.
.br
.RE
.ll
